== 3. SQL(ctx)
as accountant:
  SELECT "id", "number" FROM "invoices" WHERE "customer" = ? AND "org_id" = ? LIMIT ?
  [Initech 1 10]
as viewer:
  SELECT "id", "number" FROM "invoices" WHERE "customer" = ? AND "org_id" = ? AND "status" <> ? LIMIT ?
  [Initech 1 draft 10]

== 4. Writing
Update: 1 row marked paid
Save: INV-002 customer is now Umbrella Corp
Delete: 1 empty line removed

== 5. Guards
no Limit: ErrUnbounded=true: velox: gen.Invoice: query has no Limit: add Limit, or Unbounded to read every row
no Where: ErrNoWhere=true: velox: gen.Line: update or delete has no Where: add Where, or All to change every row

== 6. Policy and tenants
viewer's update: ErrDenied=true: velox: gen.Invoice: update denied by policy: only accountants change billing data
viewer sees 2 invoices of org 1 (not the draft)
org 2 sees 1 invoice
org 2 asks for org 1's INV-003: ErrNotFound=true
no tenant in the context: ErrNoTenant=true: velox: gen.Invoice: no tenant in the context

== 7. Transactions
INV-003 is taken (unique constraint on invoices.org_id, invoices.number); using INV-004
committed: org 1 has 4 invoices

